## Red remediation F-G2 + F-G3 (blockers from the task 3.1 www gate, HEAD e6ee343dd)

Two stale tests contradicted the new spec.

### F-G2 — products-page-pictures.red.test.tsx (track www_products_images_20261115)

The guard at line 69 rejected any productPictures src matching /2026-11-06/. It
now hits the spec-mandated /images/tutor-advantage-hero-2026-11-06.webp (spec
D-2/D-3 of www_tutor_followups_20261118). Fix (commit `5e5990b42`, this file
only): the guard rejects only the retired Storytime set — a directory segment
ending in 2026-11-06 (`/2026-11-06\//`, which matches the
storytime-cover-options-2026-11-06 handoff set named in
measure/archive/storytime_look_20261107/test-strategy.md M39) or a storytime
cover file stamped with that date (`storytime.*2026-11-06|cover-options-
2026-11-06`). The tutor hero carries the date only as a file suffix, so the
guard accepts it. One comment line names spec D-2 of www_tutor_followups_20261118.
A node check proved each pattern: the three retired-set shapes fail the guard,
the tutor hero passes it.

